crap4dart CRAP = comp^2 * (1 - coverage/100) + comp.
- _retireSeededCopy: comp ~7. Worst plausible coverage from the merged shards: the new test runs in shard 0 or 1 and hits these lines; even if only 50% lines covered → 49*0.5+7 = 31.5 — marginally over 30! Let me compute line-level coverage of the helper from the new test properly.

